growing up in the spotlight is never  easy but keeping the spotlight seemed to  be even harder for Miranda Cosgrove  whatever happened to one of the world's  biggest child stars you may know her as  the iconic Carly from Nickelodeon's  iCarly or Jack Black's protege in the  blockbuster hit School of Rock but the  27 year old actress slowly faded out of  Hollywood after her hugely successful  trials of career ended back in 2012 so  why exactly did Hollywood stop casting  Miranda Cosgrove shockingly a break from  the spotlight was her plan from the  start and her comeback into the world of  acting is only just beginning I think  anyone can be an inspiration in their  own way Miranda never set out to be  discovered instead the world of red  carpets and flashing lights found her  the actress was signed to an agent at  just three years old after being spotted  singing and dancing during a casual  family dinner  in fact her parents saw it as a way to  help her future outside of the  entertainment biz Miranda even admitted  to USA Today that when she first started  acting her parents literally thought  she'd get a few commercials and they put  it in a college fund however fate had  other plans and it turned out that their  daughters potential was just too big to  contain in the blink of an eye the LA  native was breaking Guinness records for  being the second highest-paid child  actor only behind two and a half men's  Angus Jones landed her first Hollywood  role in 2003 with Jack Black in School  of Rock the film's huge box-office  success  basically catapulted her into the world  of Nickelodeon where she grew up  alongside fan favorite stars like Josh  Peck Drake Bell and Jamie Lynn Spears  she first impressed the television  industry with her role as a devious  little sister Megan Parker on Drake and  Josh the networks loved her work so much  she sprinkled her talent on TVs around  the world as many different characters  her quick wit and hilarious acting  landed her appearances on plenty of hit  series like grounded for life what's new  scooby-doo and lilo and Stitch she even  lived out every teens dream of being an  elite PC a student on zoey 101  although fans of Drake and Josh were  forced to bid a sad farewell to Megan  Parker when the show wrapped in 2007  Nickelodeon wasn't quite ready to let  Miranda escape their grips going from a  prankster younger sister to an Internet  sweetheart her career took off when she  scored her own show that  of you may have heard of iCarly she's  Carly Carly Sam Miranda alongside  jennette mccurdy and nathan kress  brought the quirky and spirited carly  shay and her best friends Sam Puckett  and Freddie Benson to life being one of  the first shows to delve into the world  of online entertainment in social media  iCarly was an instant hit for the  network and Miranda soon became a  household name across North America  winning and presenting awards at the  Nickelodeon Kids Choice Awards quickly  became a yearly tradition for the cast  and soon Miranda was scouted by another  major production company the one the  only Disney while in the midst of  filming iCarly  Miranda was offered the opportunity to  voice Despicable meas Margo and much  like School of Rock the animated film  was a huge success  it was so successful among the younger  demographic that she went on to voice  the spunky character for two more  sequels credit after credits seemed to  stack on Miranda's resume the things  mysteriously began to slow down as she  got older while she strived to move away  from her younger audience and take on  more mature roles her movies like the  intruders were met with staggering low  ratings and she just couldn't shake her  Nickelodeon sweetheart image luckily for  her she found music as a way to reach  audiences outside of her young fans in  between filming for iCarly the star  released multiple hit songs her album  sparks fly even debuted at number eight  on the Billboard charts but in 2011 when  she embarked on her first ever tour  tragedy struck her tour bus was involved  in accidents and left her with a broken  ankle and a list of canceled concert  dates  although fans expected her to reschedule  there was never any news on a make up  tour and the a-lister quietly left the  music scene returning to icarly for one  more season the show wrapped in 2012 and  the actress's career literally came to a  halt while it left fans of the actress  wondering why exactly she was being  rejected from Hollywood  Miranda admits leaving a spotlight was  always part of her plan her parents  dream of Miranda one day attending  college was never forgotten  in fact the actress carried the same  mindset into her adult  being able to go to college was my goal  is what she confessed during an  interview with USA Today that's right  the actress wind from challenging  Authority to securing a spot in one of  America's most prestigious universities  fresh off of set this actress took on  the world of textbooks and tests at the  University of Southern California where  she set out to do what we all do at  least once in our lives find herself  because she was pushed into Hollywood at  such a young age  Miranda truly wanted to discover whether  acting was the right career path for her  it was really important to me to go to  college and just see what other  opportunities were out there don't panic  after four years and no doubt a ton of  essays Miranda completed a degree in  psychology but has realized that acting  will always be her passion it's what I  really love and want to do according to  the su journal the child star also went  to college with the intention of trying  to build a name for herself outside of  icarly  one where the industry and her fans  wouldn't always associate Nickelodeon  with the actress in some way I wonder if  I'd never done anything  would I be seen in a different way I  played Carly for so long it's hard for  some people to think of me as someone  else a world well miranda cosgrove isn't  carly shay and that even exists no one  knows for sure but since her graduation  miranda has been putting a huge effort  into landing some edgier and more mature  roles and so far things have gone  smoothly  it looks like the actress might be well  on her way to being welcomed back into  mainstream media and if her upcoming  projects are any indication we should  all be excited if you thought Miranda  working with Jack Black was absolute  peak energy  wait until you see photos of the iCarly  star with her new BFF the queen of  acting herself Betty White  following her time in school Miranda  landed her first major television role  since icarly on the comedy series  crowded where she played shame or a  young adult who was looking to move back  in with her parents  although the comedy only lasted one  season Miranda seems to have formed a  tight bond with Betty when she  guest-starred on the series I guess we  could call her the fifth golden girl not  only did Betty post about her new  friendship herself thrilled to be  working with old friends and new on at  NBC crowded but Miranda also posted a  birthday tribute to the Golden Girls  star calling her one of the sweetest  most talented people she's ever met  working in comedy made for an older  audience and making some iconic  connections is just the tip of the  iceberg when it comes to Miranda's adult  career oh no we didn't practice we did  the exact thing everyone accuses our  generation of in 2019 she made her  return to the big screen with the very  adult thriller  30:22 not only was it a completely new  vibe for the audience but an entirely  different experience for Miranda things  have continued to pick up for the star  with a schedule of projects set to be  released right into summer 2020 the  actress will be reuniting with Pharrell  Williams for his newest film North  Hollywood that will focus on pro skaters  and is even to set to make an appearance  on Hollywood game night alongside Ellen  DeGeneres's DJ twitch Amber Riley and  the iconic Bill Nye the Science Guy she  spent the last few months dabbling in  the world of producing and hosting with  her newest CBS serious mission  unstoppable looks like her college  degree may be coming in handy for her  newest adventure the series is meant to  give young girls a look at some of the  most empowering women in careers of  science math and technology around the  world and according to E W she's loving  being able to reconnect with her fans in  such a different way it's been really  fun just like getting to be part of  something like this and it's totally new  for me as for her career Miranda admits  that her dreams of becoming a pop star  have been put to rest for now  sometimes I'll play my guitar and I'll  sing songs and put them on Instagram but  that's really all I'm doing right now  for the most part it's just something  that I do on the side sometimes while  things have definitely changed since her  last time being a torturous younger  sister or up-and-coming web star Miranda  has made it clear that the amazing  connection she's made over the years are  just as strong as they were decades ago  this elaborate United with her school of  rock classmates back in 2016 for the  Broadway premiere where they looked  closer than ever  speaking the bustle Miranda says I'm  friends with all of them and describes  that their unique relationships have  left her with strong connections across  the whole country when I visit other  states there's pretty much one kid from  the movie in every state so wherever I  go visit somewhere I have a built-in  friend to meet up with Miranda's time on  Nickelodeon was also impactful in more  ways than just Fame the cast of both  Drake and Josh and iCarly have become  almost like family to the star jennette  mccurdy to this day is still the  actresses best friend from Disney World  dates to loving birthday messages their  tight bond has been plastered all across  social media over the  years she's the friend that everyone  deserves her on-screen brothers have  also capped a special place in her heart  in recent birthday messages to Jerry  Trainor the actors complimented her  former classmates for being the absolute  perfect team meant and thanks to  internet sensations david dobrik fans  got the reunion they deserved between  miranda and josh pat known for his  hilarious antics and outrageous pranks  david orchestrated a huge surprise for  josh that involves seeing Miranda for  the first time in so many years  he looks good boob in good old-fashioned  fun Miranda ends the reunion with a  classic pie in the face joke to prove  just how the two still care for each  other  they gave their fans the mostest algid  trip back to childhood where they  reacted to their past selves Miranda  loves to post throwback photos she finds  from her time on set while wanting to  make a name for herself outside of her  childhood is definitely understandable I  mean who would want to be remembered as  their preteen self forever Miranda  definitely recognizes how important her  earlier years were for her career in  fact she's not even opposed to a future  reboot she says she recognizes how her  fans feel about the series because of  her excitement over the revamp Lizzie  McGuire and admits she wants to keep  doing comedy and maybe someday icarly  would be fun to revisit it looks like  miranda cosgrove former co-stars haven't  stopped supporting the actress she might  have taken some time off to find herself  but doesn't that mean she's just like  you and I plus you have to admit her  glow up was epic are you looking forward  to this former Nickelodeon stars  upcoming projects would you watch an  icarly reboot let us know what you think  in the comment section below don't  forget to stay connected to the things  by hitting that subscribe button and  turning on your notifications until next  time

